# Paths are relative to THIS file, which already lives in vision/ — so the
# patterns must not repeat that prefix. Written as "vision/models/" they
# resolved to vision/vision/models/ and matched nothing, and a `git add -A`
# would have committed the 108 MB ONNX model and the built index.
#
# Both are built, never committed: see the DINOv2 section in ../CLAUDE.md for
# the download and build_index.py commands.
models/
index/
# index-hash/ and any other side-by-side index built to compare embedders
index-*/
